WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:02.851
The sea is calm tonight.

00:00:03.051 --> 00:00:06.706
A small boat, a quiet sky, and nowhere we have to be.

00:00:06.906 --> 00:00:09.334
From here, there are two ways to travel.

00:00:09.534 --> 00:00:12.476
Up, into the air. Or down, into the water.

00:00:12.676 --> 00:00:13.869
You decide.

